do_2 = "Update the existing provider expectations at services/explorer/backend/apps/block_scout_web/test/block_scout_web/controllers/account/api/v2/authenticate_controller_test.exs:319 to require four calls including GET /.well-known/jwks.json returning the matching public key, retain the OTP and management-token POSTs and user GET, and assert the OTP POST carries the submitted email and code; exercise the real router, controller and Auth0 verifier while preserving the HTTP 200, email and name assertions at authenticate_controller_test.exs:369 and leaving production signature and claim checks intact."
